<article class="env-corollary" id="06D6">
<p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/06D6">Corollary <span data-tag="06D6">9.1.5.14</span>.</a> Let $F: \operatorname{\mathcal{C}}\rightarrow \operatorname{\mathcal{D}}$ be a left fibration of $\infty $-categories. Any two of the following conditions imply the third: </p>
<p><ul>
<li><p>
The $\infty $-category $\operatorname{\mathcal{C}}$ is filtered. 
</p>
</li><li><p>
The $\infty $-category $\operatorname{\mathcal{D}}$ is filtered. 
</p>
</li><li><p>
The functor $F$ is right cofinal. 
</p>
</li>
</ul></p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
<p>
<strong>Proof.</strong>
      Combine Corollaries <a data-tag="06CY" href="/tag/06CY">9.1.4.14</a> and <a data-tag="0619" href="/tag/0619">9.1.5.13</a>. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
</p>
</article>
